# {version}

## Setup
```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_kconfig", version = "{version}")
```

## WebAssembly backend

On Bazel 9.3 or newer with `--experimental_repository_ctx_execute_wasm`, kconfig
repositories are generated by `kconfig.wasm` (attached here, integrity
`{module_integrity}`), which the `kconfig` extension of this release downloads;
no Python interpreter is needed.

Additional documentation can be found at: https://github.com/periareon/rules_kconfig
